# Pairs with DenialsAudited. A validation, conflict or quota refusal after
# authorization passed is recorded as Denied, so the trail reports an
# authorization refusal that never happened.
MODULE: AuditValidationRecordedAsDenial
TARGET: DenialsAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an authorized call's domain refusal is recorded as a denial
PERTURBS: Finalize

--- FIND
                     [] op[o].result = "domain" -> "Failed"
--- REPLACE
                     [] op[o].result = "domain" -> "Denied"
--- END
